   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support of Social Reforms in Ceara - PROARES III- Phase II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo principal del PROARES III-2 es reducir la vulnerabilidad y el riesgo social de las personas y sus familias en los municipios m&#xE1;s pobres de Cear&#xE1;.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the program is to reduce the vulnerability and social risk of individuals and their families in the poorest municipalities of Cear&#xE1;.</narrative>
  </description>
